    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scila and the Diamond Dragon</i> is a third\u2011person exploratory game designed for children and families. You play as Scila, a brave girl tasked with helping the Diamond Dragon recover its five lost scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore a colorful, surprise\u2011filled world, meeting other children with their little dragons. Each will present a fun challenge: minigames that foster curiosity and teamwork. Completing each challenge rewards you with one scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all five scales are collected, you can ride the Diamond Dragon in a magical final level: a beautiful flight along a sparkling stream, returning home safely.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scila and the Diamond Dragon</i> is a third\u2011person exploratory game designed for children and families. You play as Scila, a brave girl tasked with helping the Diamond Dragon recover its five lost scales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore a colorful, surprise\u2011filled world, meeting other children with their little dragons. Each will present a fun challenge: minigames that foster curiosity and teamwork. Completing each challenge rewards you with one scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once all five scales are collected, you can ride the Diamond Dragon in a magical final level: a beautiful flight along a sparkling stream, returning home safely.</p>",
    "short_description": "Scila and the Diamond Dragon is a third-person exploration adventure designed for young children. Help Scila recover the lost scales of the Diamond Dragon by overcoming challenges and minigames with lots of little dragon friends!",
